        "Description": "Seperated since birth , fraternal twins Sophia and Carmine are the closest they&apos;ve ever been. Sophia and Carmine both share a track record of heinous crimes, Sophia being a tabloid reporter that is not afraid to commit multiple sins for jucier headlines. Carmine, on the other hand, is a notorious con artist, known for tricking high profile indivisuals out of precious belongings, and is currently finding a time slot to pursue Dino Bosco. Our client has asked us to eliminate them before they meet.",
